 mère et qui m'a appelé par sa grâce,"},"interlinear":[{"greek":"Ὅτε","gloss":"Mais_quand"},{"greek":"δὲ","gloss":"or"},{"greek":"εὐδόκησεν","gloss":"il_plut/trouva_bon"},{"greek":"ὁ","gloss":"celui"},{"greek":"ἀφορίσας","gloss":"ayant_mis_à_part"},{"greek":"με","gloss":"moi"},{"greek":"ἐκ","gloss":"dès"},{"greek":"κοιλίας","gloss":"le_ventre/sein"},{"greek":"μητρός","gloss":"de_la_mère"},{"greek":"μου","gloss":"de_moi"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"καλέσας","gloss":"m'ayant_appelé"},{"greek":"διὰ","gloss":"par"},{"greek":"τῆς","gloss":"la"},{"greek":"χάριτος","gloss":"grâce"},{"greek":"αὐτοῦ","gloss":"de_lui"}]},{"verse_number":16,"translations":{"segond":"de révéler en moi son Fils, afin que je l'annonçasse parmi les païens, aussitôt, je ne consultai ni la chair ni le sang,","darby":"de révéler son Fils en moi, afin que je l'évangélisasse parmi les nations, aussitôt je ne pris pas conseil de la chair ni du sang,"},"interlinear":[{"greek":"ἀποκαλύψαι","gloss":"de_révéler"},{"greek":"τὸν","gloss":"le"},{"greek":"υἱὸν","gloss":"Fils"},{"greek":"αὐτοῦ","gloss":"de_lui"},{"greek":"ἐν","gloss":"en"},{"greek":"ἐμοί,","gloss":"moi"},{"greek":"ἵνα","gloss":"afin_que"},{"greek":"εὐαγγελίζωμαι","gloss":"je_l'annonce"},{"greek":"αὐτὸν","gloss":"lui"},{"greek":"ἐν","gloss":"parmi"},{"greek":"τοῖς","gloss":"les"},{"greek":"ἔθνεσιν,","gloss":"païens/nations"},{"greek":"εὐθέως","gloss":"aussitôt"},{"greek":"οὐ","gloss":"non"},{"greek":"προσανεθέμην","gloss":"je_ne_consultai"},{"greek":"σαρκὶ","gloss":"la_chair"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"αἵματι,","gloss":"le_sang"}]},{"verse_number":17,"translations":{"segond":"et je ne montai point à Jérusalem vers ceux qui furent apôtres avant moi, mais je partis pour l'Arabie, et je revins encore à Damas.","darby":"et je ne montai pas à Jérusalem vers ceux qui étaient apôtres avant moi, mais je m'en allai en Arabie, et je retournai de nouveau à Damas."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"οὐδὲ","gloss":"et_ne_pas"},{"greek":"ἀνῆλθον","gloss":"je_montai"},{"greek":"εἰς","gloss":"vers"},{"greek":"Ἱεροσόλυμα","gloss":"Jérusalem"},{"greek":"πρὸς","gloss":"auprès_de"},{"greek":"τοὺς","gloss":"ceux"},{"greek":"πρὸ","gloss":"avant"},{"greek":"ἐμοῦ","gloss":"moi"},{"greek":"ἀποστόλους,","gloss":"apôtres"},{"greek":"ἀλλὰ","gloss":"mais"},{"greek":"ἀπῆλθον","gloss":"je_m'en_allai"},{"greek":"εἰς","gloss":"vers"},{"greek":"Ἀραβίαν,","gloss":"l'Arabie"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"πάλιν","gloss":"de_nouveau"},{"greek":"ὑπέστρεψα","gloss":"je_retournai"},{"greek":"εἰς","gloss":"vers"},{"greek":"Δαμασκόν.","gloss":"Damas"}]},{"verse_number":18,"translations":{"segond":"Trois ans plus tard, je montai à Jérusalem pour faire la connaissance de Céphas, et je demeurai quinze jours chez lui.","darby":"Ensuite, trois ans après, je montai à Jérusalem pour faire la connaissance de Céphas, et je demeurai chez lui quinze jours;"},"interlinear":[{"greek":"Ἔπειτα","gloss":"Ensuite"},{"greek":"μετὰ","gloss":"après"},{"greek":"ἔτη","gloss":"ans"},{"greek":"τρία","gloss":"trois"},{"greek":"ἀνῆλθον","gloss":"je_montai"},{"greek":"εἰς","gloss":"vers"},{"greek":"Ἱεροσόλυμα","gloss":"Jérusalem"},{"greek":"ἱστορῆσαι","gloss":"pour_connaître/rendre_visite"},{"greek":"Κηφᾶν,","gloss":"Céphas"},{"greek":"καὶ","gloss":"et"},{"greek":"ἐπέμεινα","gloss":"je_demeurai"},{"greek":"πρὸς","gloss":"auprès_de"},{"greek":"αὐτὸν","gloss":"lui"},{"greek":"ἡμέρας","gloss":"jours"},{"greek":"δεκαπέντε·","gloss":"quinze"}]},{"verse_number":19,"translations":{"segond":"Mais je ne vis aucun autre des apôtres, si ce n'est Jacques, le frère du Seigneur.","darby":"mais je ne vis aucun autre des apôtres, sinon Jacques le frère du Seigneur."},"interlinear":[{"greek":"ἕτερον","gloss":"un_autre"},{"greek":"δὲ","gloss":"mais"},{"greek":"τῶν","gloss":"des"},{"greek":"ἀποστόλων","gloss":"apôtres"},{"greek":"οὐκ","gloss":"je_ne_pas"},{"greek":"εἶδον","gloss":"vis"},{"greek":"εἰ","gloss":"si"},{"greek":"μὴ","gloss":"ce_n'est"},{"greek":"Ἰάκωβον","g